   "heading": "About Center",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "VISION STATEMENT To provide an open, compassionate and dignified shelter for our Community. MISSION STATEMENT The Fredericton Homeless Shelters Inc. provides safe, stable and temporary refuge to individuals experiencing homelessness. We foster a caring and respectful environment that promotes dignity and self-determination.",
